WEBVTT

00:00:13.760 --> 00:00:15.460
I'm home.

00:00:15.810 --> 00:00:17.240
What's wrong, Nagisa?

00:00:17.240 --> 00:00:18.330
You don't have much energy.

00:00:18.330 --> 00:00:19.370
Did you catch a cold?

00:00:19.370 --> 00:00:21.150
No, I'm fine.

00:00:29.760 --> 00:00:31.140
What can I do for you caru?

00:00:31.450 --> 00:00:34.280
Spical! Please grant Pollun's wish mepo.

00:00:34.540 --> 00:00:35.720
Popo... Popo... Popo!

00:00:35.720 --> 00:00:36.950
All right caru.

00:00:36.950 --> 00:00:38.420
Look carefully, Pollun...

00:00:38.420 --> 00:00:39.380
Popo?

00:00:39.590 --> 00:00:42.350
This is what Christmas is like 
on the Field of Rainbows mepo.

00:00:42.590 --> 00:00:46.520
Look at it closely, and wish for a 
Christmas-like, romantic scene mepo.

00:00:46.520 --> 00:00:48.450
It's for Nagisa's sake popo...

00:00:48.450 --> 00:00:49.990
Popo... popo... popo... popo...

00:00:52.450 --> 00:00:53.840
Okay caru.

00:00:53.840 --> 00:00:57.140
Master Pollun... Is this 
what you wished for caru?

00:01:03.960 --> 00:01:05.010
Popo! Popo! Popo!

00:01:05.010 --> 00:01:08.800
Pollun! What good is it going to do to wish 
for nothing but reindeer like this mepo?

00:01:08.800 --> 00:01:10.550
Do it again mepo!

00:01:10.550 --> 00:01:12.010
Popo... popo...

00:01:12.010 --> 00:01:14.810
Nagisa's been depressed lately, so this is

00:01:14.810 --> 00:01:17.400
supposed to put her in 
a Christmas spirit, and

00:01:17.400 --> 00:01:19.380
try to cheer her up mepo!

00:01:19.380 --> 00:01:21.170
It's for Nagisa's sake popo!

00:01:21.170 --> 00:01:22.460
Popo... popo... popo... popo... popo...

00:01:25.310 --> 00:01:28.280
Master Pollun... is this 
what you wished for caru?

00:01:31.620 --> 00:01:32.970
Popopo!

00:01:32.970 --> 00:01:34.870
This isn't it either mepo!

00:01:34.870 --> 00:01:35.660
Popo!

00:01:35.660 --> 00:01:37.820
Don't you know...?

00:01:37.820 --> 00:01:39.910
An atmosphere that will touch her heart, and

00:01:39.910 --> 00:01:42.150
give her a feeling of excitement mepo.

00:01:42.450 --> 00:01:43.520
Popo?

00:01:44.520 --> 00:01:46.990
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:01:46.990 --> 00:01:49.650
<i>Pretty Cure Pretty Cure</i>

00:01:49.790 --> 00:01:52.420
<i>Pretty Cure Pretty Cure</i>

00:01:52.620 --> 00:01:56.890
<i>We're pretty and cure cure Together we are...</i>

00:01:56.890 --> 00:01:59.600
<i>PRETTY CURE...!</i>

00:01:59.860 --> 00:02:02.730
<i>Out of the frying pan, into the fire</i>

00:02:02.830 --> 00:02:04.340
<i>Frankly, it's totally unbelievable</i>

00:02:05.840 --> 00:02:08.340
<i>Even in our school in our 
school uniforms, we're both</i>

00:02:08.540 --> 00:02:10.140
<i>amazingly tough</i>

00:02:11.640 --> 00:02:15.950
<i>Each time we get out of a tight spot,</i>

00:02:16.580 --> 00:02:17.920
<i>we both</i>

00:02:18.050 --> 00:02:19.250
<i>become stronger</i>

00:02:19.350 --> 00:02:21.820
<i>and closer</i>

00:02:22.820 --> 00:02:25.820
<i>Yeah! Your best! My best! Because we're alive</i>

00:02:25.820 --> 00:02:28.390
<i>we never fail!</i>

00:02:28.660 --> 00:02:31.560
<i>Don't you know that good fortune</i>

00:02:31.560 --> 00:02:34.130
<i>comes to the gates of laughter?
Out with the negative!</i>

00:02:34.430 --> 00:02:40.300
<i>Brighten up your life!
Try with all your might...</i>

00:02:40.710 --> 00:02:41.610
<i>Work like the devil!</i>

00:02:41.610 --> 00:02:44.080
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:02:44.310 --> 00:02:47.110
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:02:47.110 --> 00:02:51.380
<i>We're pretty and cure cure Together we are</i>

00:02:51.580 --> 00:02:54.450
<i>Pretty Cure!</i>

00:02:54.650 --> 00:02:58.190
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:03:01.630 --> 00:03:02.670
Mepo...?

00:03:02.670 --> 00:03:04.400
Yui's got courage...

00:03:04.400 --> 00:03:07.740
She was able to give Fuji 
P his birthday present...

00:03:08.350 --> 00:03:11.070
While I'm such a coward.

00:03:11.440 --> 00:03:13.590
I gave Yui encouragement,

00:03:13.590 --> 00:03:17.940
but when I'm in front of Fuji 
P, my mind just goes blank.

00:03:17.940 --> 00:03:20.280
I can't say anything worthwhile.

00:03:20.980 --> 00:03:22.650
Tomorrow is Christmas Eve...

00:03:22.650 --> 00:03:25.010
I'll bet Fuji P will be 
getting lots of presents

00:03:25.010 --> 00:03:27.940
at the party after the closing ceremony...

00:03:27.940 --> 00:03:29.650
Lots and lots...

00:03:30.830 --> 00:03:32.080
Look at that, Pollun.

00:03:32.080 --> 00:03:34.100
Nagisa's troubled mepo.

00:03:34.100 --> 00:03:34.950
Popo!

00:03:34.950 --> 00:03:38.380
Hey! Don't read my diary 
without my permission!

00:03:38.380 --> 00:03:41.170
Can't I have any privacy at all?

00:03:41.170 --> 00:03:42.830
You don't have to get so angry mepo!

00:03:43.220 --> 00:03:46.300
Anyone would get angry if 
their privacy is invaded.

00:03:46.620 --> 00:03:48.770
After we went to the trouble of turning

00:03:48.770 --> 00:03:52.110
into Santa, and getting you 
a special present mepo.

00:03:52.470 --> 00:03:53.320
That's right popo!

00:03:53.320 --> 00:03:54.700
We turned into Santa, and...

00:03:56.410 --> 00:03:57.910
What's Santa popo?

00:03:58.910 --> 00:04:02.540
Santa is the person who delivers 
presents to everyone on Christmas.

00:04:03.530 --> 00:04:06.410
Don't you remember? A lot of 
him came out earlier mepo.

00:04:07.810 --> 00:04:08.930
You're wrong popo.

00:04:08.930 --> 00:04:12.230
The person who comes on Christmas 
isn't an old man like that popo.

00:04:12.230 --> 00:04:13.260
Mepo?

00:04:13.680 --> 00:04:15.130
It's not an old man...?

00:04:15.130 --> 00:04:17.530
It's a child who will come popo.

00:04:17.530 --> 00:04:21.270
Listen here... Santa has 
always been an old man.

00:04:21.620 --> 00:04:22.550
Popo?

00:04:27.160 --> 00:04:30.350
"I COULDN'T BE HAPPIER?! 
NAGISA'S WHITE CHRISTMAS"

00:04:41.070 --> 00:04:42.410
Just wait, Fuji P...

00:04:42.410 --> 00:04:45.060
I'll make you the most delicious chocolate.

00:05:20.340 --> 00:05:22.370
What's wrong, Queen?

00:05:45.040 --> 00:05:46.920
Is it Jyaku-King?

00:05:48.080 --> 00:05:50.910
Another world has disappeared.

00:05:51.310 --> 00:05:52.300
Oh, no...

00:05:56.140 --> 00:06:00.410
The Power of Annihilation has 
swallowed up another world.

00:06:00.650 --> 00:06:04.740
Are you saying that Jyaku-King can 
manipulate something that strong?

00:06:05.020 --> 00:06:09.210
And eventually, everything 
will fall prey to Jyaku-King.

00:06:09.390 --> 00:06:16.390
Jyaku-King is fighting against the Power 
of Annihilation that's inside his body.

00:06:16.390 --> 00:06:18.660
I don't need your unnecessary probing.

00:06:18.660 --> 00:06:24.600
Your only mission is to bring the 
Power of Creation back here...

00:06:24.920 --> 00:06:27.510
Just for me.

00:06:27.970 --> 00:06:29.890
Whoever stands in the way 
of my eternity is fated

00:06:29.890 --> 00:06:33.300
to be buried and done with 
by the power of darkness.

00:06:33.840 --> 00:06:37.940
You, who are a part of me, are no exceptions.

00:06:43.360 --> 00:06:46.480
Jyaku-King already knows what's going on...

00:06:46.810 --> 00:06:49.450
But what is that power and energy...?

00:06:50.160 --> 00:06:54.430
If we go along with Jyaku-King, 
we could have eternal life...

00:06:54.760 --> 00:06:56.110
What eternity...?

00:06:56.110 --> 00:06:57.770
We'll be servants for eternity.

00:06:58.140 --> 00:07:00.780
Even if Jyaku-King becomes 
complete, there is no

00:07:00.780 --> 00:07:05.370
guarantee that we will be freed 
from the Power of Annihilation.

00:07:05.730 --> 00:07:09.110
But, that power of Jyaku-King's...

00:07:09.110 --> 00:07:13.850
We'll be fighting against 
the Power of Annihilation.

00:07:14.260 --> 00:07:15.310
That's enough!

00:07:16.320 --> 00:07:17.320
I told you, didn't I?

00:07:19.130 --> 00:07:22.250
We are no longer what we 
were when we were born.

00:07:22.610 --> 00:07:26.090
We have grown by drawing on chaotic power

00:07:26.090 --> 00:07:29.550
that this Field of Rainbows 
is overflowing with.

00:07:30.000 --> 00:07:32.200
Just as Pretty Cure is growing.

00:07:33.040 --> 00:07:34.090
Growing...?

00:07:35.900 --> 00:07:37.370
You don't look any different.

00:07:37.840 --> 00:07:39.170
You be quiet.

00:07:46.840 --> 00:07:47.780
Be quiet!

00:07:50.050 --> 00:07:51.110
However...

00:07:51.110 --> 00:07:55.360
Our powers have become so immeasurable that

00:07:55.360 --> 00:07:59.160
we no longer need to worry about Jyaku-King.

00:08:02.340 --> 00:08:04.130
For the sake of our freedom...

00:08:04.700 --> 00:08:09.570
So that we, ourselves, can be freed 
from the Power of Annihilation...

00:08:11.880 --> 00:08:13.740
That can't be...!

00:08:14.990 --> 00:08:18.160
Don't tell me that they're seriously 
thinking of going against Jyaku-King?

00:08:21.500 --> 00:08:22.940
Verone Academy

00:08:48.230 --> 00:08:50.180
Natsuko's really getting into it.

00:08:50.890 --> 00:08:53.710
I'm going to dance until the party ends.

00:08:55.700 --> 00:08:57.500
This year's party is as 
grand as ever, isn't it?

00:08:57.500 --> 00:09:00.040
It doesn't feel like Christmas until the

00:09:00.040 --> 00:09:02.040
student body party starts, does it?

00:09:04.580 --> 00:09:07.250
Principal! You're burning 
up the floor, aren't you?

00:09:07.250 --> 00:09:10.150
The students are still no match for me.

00:09:10.150 --> 00:09:11.470
Me either...

00:09:13.620 --> 00:09:14.990
Vice Principal...

00:09:16.080 --> 00:09:18.600
That looks more like "Awa-odori" 
(traditional Japanese bon dance).

00:09:18.600 --> 00:09:21.370
Stop kidding around.

00:09:26.420 --> 00:09:28.080
Wow!

00:09:31.350 --> 00:09:32.740
The party's in full swing.

00:09:32.740 --> 00:09:36.660
I'm going to dance with Nakajuma-kun 
from the kendo (Japanese fencing) team.

00:09:36.660 --> 00:09:38.250
Me, too... Me, too!

00:09:38.250 --> 00:09:39.770
I'm going to dance with somebody.

00:09:39.770 --> 00:09:41.390
Charge!

00:09:42.840 --> 00:09:44.150
Me, too!

00:09:44.150 --> 00:09:45.010
Nagisa!

00:09:45.330 --> 00:09:46.350
Yui?

00:09:47.050 --> 00:09:48.710
Thank you for the other day.

00:09:49.600 --> 00:09:51.300
But, it was no good.

00:09:52.170 --> 00:09:55.490
When I gave him the present, 
I somehow got up enough

00:09:55.490 --> 00:09:57.480
courage to tell him how I felt, but...

00:09:57.950 --> 00:09:58.680
What did he say?

00:09:59.540 --> 00:10:01.650
He said, "I'm sorry."

00:10:04.010 --> 00:10:06.960
I wonder if there's someone else...

00:10:09.190 --> 00:10:10.430
Is that right?

00:10:10.780 --> 00:10:13.490
But I wouldn't have had the courage 
if it weren't for you, Nagisa.

00:10:13.780 --> 00:10:14.930
I didn't do anything...

00:10:15.150 --> 00:10:18.670
But I'm not going to let something 
like this get me down.

00:10:26.970 --> 00:10:29.200
I have to give Yui credit.

00:10:29.200 --> 00:10:32.590
She's giving herself encouragement, 
so she can get back on her feet again.

00:10:32.590 --> 00:10:34.910
You can give it to him today, can't you?

00:10:35.090 --> 00:10:37.220
Don't scare me like that.

00:10:37.220 --> 00:10:38.720
What are you talking about anyway?

00:10:38.720 --> 00:10:44.110
I thought since it's Christmas, you 
could give Fujimura-kun a present.

00:10:44.680 --> 00:10:46.300
Well, I...

00:10:46.300 --> 00:10:47.130
Honoka!

00:10:47.710 --> 00:10:49.460
Fujimura-kun! Kimata-kun!

00:10:49.730 --> 00:10:51.360
Merry Christmas, Misumi-san.

00:10:51.360 --> 00:10:54.330
Thank you... Very Merry Christmas.

00:10:57.210 --> 00:10:58.100
Popo!

00:11:06.870 --> 00:11:10.170
Honoka... Wasn't it your 
class that's going to be

00:11:10.170 --> 00:11:11.820
the school representative 
in the year-end Seibu

00:11:11.820 --> 00:11:13.450
Regional Middle School Singing Competition?

00:11:14.250 --> 00:11:16.660
If it weren't for Yabe-san 
from the music club,

00:11:16.660 --> 00:11:17.790
we wouldn't have made it.

00:11:18.140 --> 00:11:20.760
We'll be sure to cheer you 
on, so be sure you win it.

00:11:21.060 --> 00:11:22.260
It's no good, after all.

00:11:22.260 --> 00:11:25.230
I can't say anything when 
I'm in front of Fuji P.

00:11:25.480 --> 00:11:30.730
Come to think it, didn't we all go 
to help out at your grandpa's place?

00:11:30.730 --> 00:11:34.110
That's right, but there's one person missing.

00:11:34.110 --> 00:11:35.810
You mean Kiriya...?

00:11:35.810 --> 00:11:38.880
He just left all of a sudden.

00:12:10.130 --> 00:12:11.920
It snowed quite a bit, didn't it?

00:12:11.920 --> 00:12:14.060
It really is a white Christmas, isn't it?

00:12:14.060 --> 00:12:16.610
Shall we build a snowman?

00:12:16.610 --> 00:12:17.610
You're kidding, aren't you?

00:12:17.610 --> 00:12:19.320
Come on! Let's build a really big one.

00:12:19.320 --> 00:12:22.130
I wouldn't do something as childish as that.

00:12:22.130 --> 00:12:26.360
When I see all that white 
snow in front of me like

00:12:26.360 --> 00:12:29.030
this, I can't resist making a snowman.

00:12:29.220 --> 00:12:32.320
I think it's a lot more 
fun to listen to music.

00:12:32.320 --> 00:12:33.430
Wet blanket!

00:12:33.700 --> 00:12:35.230
How beautiful!

00:12:35.230 --> 00:12:36.390
It really is!

00:12:36.390 --> 00:12:38.120
Honoka...?

00:12:38.120 --> 00:12:39.360
What is it, Kimata-kun?

00:12:39.360 --> 00:12:42.540
It's cold out here, so why 
don't we go inside, and dance?

00:12:45.630 --> 00:12:46.860
Sure... It's okay.

00:12:46.860 --> 00:12:47.910
All right!

00:12:51.680 --> 00:12:52.880
Fuji P!

00:12:53.400 --> 00:12:54.820
Don't tell me he's going to ask me to dance?

00:12:56.620 --> 00:12:58.570
What should I say?

00:12:58.570 --> 00:13:01.230
If I sound too happy, I might 
seem too frivolous to him.

00:13:01.450 --> 00:13:02.400
Misumi-san?

00:13:02.400 --> 00:13:04.300
Yes? What is it?

00:13:04.300 --> 00:13:05.540
Do you like snowmen?

00:13:06.730 --> 00:13:09.430
Santa popo! Santa popo! Santa's coming popo!

00:13:15.100 --> 00:13:16.680
It's just the two of us here now...

00:13:16.680 --> 00:13:19.110
It's the perfect chance 
to give him the present.

00:13:19.710 --> 00:13:22.350
How stupid! I forgot it in the classroom...

00:13:22.350 --> 00:13:24.450
Together with his muffler.

00:13:24.860 --> 00:13:27.140
After I stayed up all night to make it...

00:13:27.510 --> 00:13:30.110
The sweetness and aroma were just perfect.

00:13:30.110 --> 00:13:31.590
Chocolate really is...

00:13:31.590 --> 00:13:32.460
Is something wrong?

00:13:32.460 --> 00:13:34.070
I really love...!

00:13:36.790 --> 00:13:41.470
I... ...really love making snowmen!

00:13:43.270 --> 00:13:44.510
It's no use...

00:13:44.510 --> 00:13:46.380
I'm just no good at this at all.

00:13:46.380 --> 00:13:48.010
That was awesome, Misumi-san!

00:13:49.240 --> 00:13:51.010
Just what I'd expect from a lacrosse ace.

00:13:51.440 --> 00:13:53.440
When did I do all this?

00:13:53.760 --> 00:13:54.910
What a difference in power...

00:13:55.100 --> 00:13:56.380
I didn't...

00:13:58.240 --> 00:14:01.320
Stop that! Don't look at me like that!

00:14:01.320 --> 00:14:03.220
The next number is...

00:14:06.960 --> 00:14:07.850
What happened?

00:14:07.850 --> 00:14:09.360
What is this...?

00:14:10.460 --> 00:14:11.560
Kimata-kun! Pull yourself together!

00:14:11.870 --> 00:14:13.530
Don't tell me this is...?

00:14:14.300 --> 00:14:15.500
It's finished.

00:14:15.790 --> 00:14:16.990
Our masterpiece.

00:14:16.990 --> 00:14:18.300
Congratulations on finishing it!

00:14:19.290 --> 00:14:20.470
Congratulations!

00:14:21.460 --> 00:14:22.940
Did you see him move?

00:14:23.730 --> 00:14:24.640
It couldn't be...!

00:14:27.720 --> 00:14:30.080
My head feels...

00:14:32.960 --> 00:14:34.950
Zakenna!

00:14:48.490 --> 00:14:50.890
Fuji P! Pull yourself together, Fuji P!

00:14:51.440 --> 00:14:52.870
What do you think you're doing?

00:14:52.870 --> 00:14:54.670
Zakenna!

00:14:55.160 --> 00:14:56.070
Nagisa!

00:14:56.770 --> 00:14:58.080
I'll be right back!

00:14:59.410 --> 00:15:00.680
Ready, Honoka?

00:15:05.370 --> 00:15:07.870
Dual Aurora Wave!

00:15:38.470 --> 00:15:40.650
Protector of the Light, Cure Black!

00:15:41.000 --> 00:15:43.250
Protector of the Light, Cure White!

00:15:45.600 --> 00:15:47.030
Together, we're Pretty Cure!

00:15:48.480 --> 00:15:50.400
Servants of the power of darkness...

00:15:51.480 --> 00:15:53.830
Go back to where you came from!

00:15:54.140 --> 00:15:56.090
Just when things were going so nicely...

00:15:56.090 --> 00:15:57.040
Don't interfere!

00:15:57.800 --> 00:15:59.500
It's a once in a lifetime thing mepo.

00:15:59.740 --> 00:16:01.470
You didn't have to say that!

00:16:23.670 --> 00:16:25.030
Merry Christmas!

00:16:26.110 --> 00:16:27.600
Where is he?

00:16:29.070 --> 00:16:30.840
Who are you talking about?

00:16:30.840 --> 00:16:34.570
He doesn't deserve to hold 
the Power of Creation.

00:16:34.570 --> 00:16:35.470
What did you say?

00:16:35.470 --> 00:16:37.040
Why are you so surprised?

00:16:37.280 --> 00:16:39.630
I'm just trying to bring 
the seven Prism Stones

00:16:39.630 --> 00:16:41.980
and the Power of Creation 
back together again.

00:16:42.870 --> 00:16:45.200
I absolutely refuse to let you do that!

00:16:45.200 --> 00:16:46.680
I'll protect it with my own hands.

00:16:47.980 --> 00:16:51.980
Nice moves! I'll admit 
that you two have grown.

00:16:53.600 --> 00:16:56.630
But it's not just you two who have grown.

00:17:05.420 --> 00:17:06.190
Popo!

00:17:08.330 --> 00:17:09.650
Black! White!

00:17:09.650 --> 00:17:10.860
So is that where you were?

00:17:10.860 --> 00:17:11.630
Popo?

00:17:11.630 --> 00:17:14.780
Do you really hold that power within you?

00:17:15.960 --> 00:17:17.320
Don't touch Pollun.

00:17:17.320 --> 00:17:18.250
Run, Pollun!

00:17:18.250 --> 00:17:19.770
Popopo...

00:17:19.770 --> 00:17:21.180
Let me go popo!

00:17:21.180 --> 00:17:22.720
It looks like the game is over.

00:17:22.980 --> 00:17:23.720
Pollun!

00:17:27.840 --> 00:17:28.670
Popo!

00:17:32.110 --> 00:17:34.130
I'll praise your spirit.

00:17:34.370 --> 00:17:37.940
No popo! Christmas is supposed 
to be more enjoyable popo.

00:17:39.900 --> 00:17:42.760
Stop it popo!

00:18:00.570 --> 00:18:03.530
Accept the power of light popo!

00:18:20.930 --> 00:18:21.580
Zakenna!

00:18:21.990 --> 00:18:23.450
Zakenna!

00:18:24.290 --> 00:18:27.190
Power of hope... Take the will of light...

00:18:27.840 --> 00:18:30.350
And fight your way toward the future!

00:18:30.680 --> 00:18:33.660
Pretty Cure Rainbow Storm!

00:19:11.500 --> 00:19:14.990
Gomenna! Gomenna! Gomenna!

00:19:20.900 --> 00:19:22.010
What is that?

00:19:23.060 --> 00:19:25.480
The warp that opened between 
the light and the dark...

00:19:26.350 --> 00:19:29.010
I was drawn to the warp...

00:19:29.980 --> 00:19:31.780
Kiriya-kun? Is that you, Kiriya-kun?

00:19:32.750 --> 00:19:35.220
It's a child who will come popo.

00:19:35.560 --> 00:19:37.690
This is what Pollun was talking about mepo!

00:19:37.910 --> 00:19:39.360
I was drawn here by...

00:19:39.360 --> 00:19:42.170
The warp that was created 
by the clash between

00:19:42.170 --> 00:19:43.660
your power and the power of darkness...

00:19:44.330 --> 00:19:47.470
Something will happen between 
the light and the dark...

00:19:47.470 --> 00:19:49.630
It will be different than 
anything up until now.

00:19:50.570 --> 00:19:52.600
The warp is trying to close itself...

00:19:53.070 --> 00:19:55.070
I have to go!

00:19:56.300 --> 00:19:57.630
Where are you going?

00:19:57.630 --> 00:19:58.510
We'll see you again, won't we?

00:19:58.840 --> 00:19:59.960
I have to go!

00:20:01.240 --> 00:20:02.870
Wait, Kiriya-kun!

00:20:12.990 --> 00:20:16.670
I'm sorry you got caught in this again...

00:20:17.460 --> 00:20:21.850
Every time I'm with you, I put you in danger.

00:20:22.700 --> 00:20:27.240
So it's better if I don't 
come near you, Fuji P.

00:20:37.690 --> 00:20:39.300
It's beautiful!

00:20:44.620 --> 00:20:46.000
You did it mepo!

00:20:46.000 --> 00:20:47.030
I did it popo!

00:20:53.590 --> 00:20:56.660
Oh no! I fell asleep!

00:20:56.660 --> 00:20:58.300
Me, too! Me, too!

00:21:02.190 --> 00:21:03.870
What happened...?

00:21:05.250 --> 00:21:06.640
My muffler...?

00:21:06.910 --> 00:21:09.750
I'm returning the muffler 
I borrowed from you.

00:21:10.250 --> 00:21:11.900
Thank you.

00:21:12.420 --> 00:21:13.630
Misumi-san...

00:21:14.470 --> 00:21:20.350
But there was a huge Christmas tree 
covered with bright lights right here!

00:21:22.010 --> 00:21:23.940
So it was a dream, after all.

00:21:24.370 --> 00:21:26.680
You were sound asleep.

00:21:26.980 --> 00:21:28.980
It was nice though...

00:21:30.170 --> 00:21:31.170
How should I put it...?

00:21:31.740 --> 00:21:33.290
It was strange...

00:21:33.290 --> 00:21:35.820
You were next to me, and 
it was just the two of

00:21:35.820 --> 00:21:38.710
us in front of such a beautiful sight.

00:21:39.230 --> 00:21:41.680
If it was a dream, I wish 
I didn't have to wake up.

00:21:43.410 --> 00:21:44.460
Misumi-san...

00:21:44.460 --> 00:21:45.450
Yes...?

00:21:46.400 --> 00:21:47.620
Merry Christmas.

00:21:52.000 --> 00:21:53.490
Merry Christmas!

00:21:54.400 --> 00:21:55.930
Mepo! Mipo! Popo!

00:21:56.590 --> 00:21:59.830
The chocolate you made was really delicious.

00:21:59.830 --> 00:22:01.850
It took all my effort just 
to return the muffler, so

00:22:01.850 --> 00:22:03.310
I missed the chance to 
give him the chocolate.

00:22:03.310 --> 00:22:04.470
That's too bad.

00:22:04.780 --> 00:22:05.730
But it's okay...

00:22:05.730 --> 00:22:08.440
Mepple and Pollun gave me 
the best Christmas present.

00:22:08.750 --> 00:22:12.280
Thanks to them, it turned out to 
be an unforgettable Christmas Eve.

00:22:12.280 --> 00:22:13.290
That's true...

00:22:13.830 --> 00:22:16.630
It was a really wonderful Christmas Eve.

00:22:24.760 --> 00:22:25.320
<i>Let's go!</i>

00:22:26.160 --> 00:22:26.860
<i>Get you!</i>

00:22:26.860 --> 00:22:29.560
<i>L-O-V-E Love Love, get you!</i>

00:22:29.660 --> 00:22:32.300
<i>I can't do this!</i>

00:22:32.530 --> 00:22:35.570
<i>I'd rather be a young lady than a fighter and</i>

00:22:35.570 --> 00:22:38.000
<i>Get you! Into a love love mode</i>

00:22:38.100 --> 00:22:42.140
<i>And melt your body and soul into sweets</i>

00:22:44.680 --> 00:22:47.850
<i>like chocolate parfait or handsome men</i>

00:22:47.910 --> 00:22:51.580
<i>I'm at the age to seriously 
fall head over heels in love</i>

00:22:52.250 --> 00:22:55.320
<i>I wanted to confess my love again today</i>

00:22:56.450 --> 00:22:59.690
<i>For the sake of the earth 
For the sake of everyone</i>

00:22:59.820 --> 00:23:06.330
<i>That's good, too, but haven't 
you forgotten something?</i>

00:23:07.430 --> 00:23:10.700
<i>I'm a teenager with a</i>

00:23:10.700 --> 00:23:13.940
<i>heart throbbing exciting dream</i>

00:23:13.940 --> 00:23:16.670
<i>I don't want to lose that</i>

00:23:16.670 --> 00:23:20.450
<i>normal everyday routine</i>

00:23:20.450 --> 00:23:22.950
<i>I just can't do this!</i>

00:23:23.180 --> 00:23:26.420
<i>It's romance rather than stress, isn't it?</i>

00:23:26.420 --> 00:23:28.590
<i>Get you! Into a love love mode</i>

00:23:28.590 --> 00:23:31.890
<i>Isn't that the best source of power?</i>

00:23:32.190 --> 00:23:34.930
<i>I just can't do this!</i>

00:23:35.390 --> 00:23:38.200
<i>I'd rather cuddle than fight and...</i>

00:23:38.200 --> 00:23:40.430
<i>Get you! Into a love love mode</i>

00:23:40.430 --> 00:23:42.970
<i>That's the most peaceful way</i>

00:23:43.100 --> 00:23:44.370
<i>So why am I</i>

00:23:44.500 --> 00:23:45.970
<i>stuffing my face</i>

00:23:46.040 --> 00:23:49.670
<i>with chocolates like this?</i>

00:23:53.940 --> 00:23:55.900
Next week is the singing competition.

00:23:55.900 --> 00:23:57.480
Let's do our best, Nagisa.

00:23:57.480 --> 00:24:00.080
What is with Chiaki anyway?
Changing the song now.

00:24:00.080 --> 00:24:01.290
That won't be easy.

00:24:01.290 --> 00:24:03.010
It's usually at a time like this that...

00:24:03.010 --> 00:24:04.920
Are they coming? Are they coming?
 So they're coming, after all.

00:24:04.920 --> 00:24:07.030
Give me a break!

00:24:07.230 --> 00:24:09.850
"I just can't handle this."

00:24:09.850 --> 00:24:12.700
It's "romance rather than stress," isn't it?

00:24:12.700 --> 00:24:16.900
"SING, SAKURA CLASS! THE CHOIR SHOWS COURAGE"

00:24:16.900 --> 00:24:19.080
The song that Chiaki chose...?

00:24:19.080 --> 00:24:20.020
Is it...?
